%
N:N: O'Neill's key signature for this tune is D, so all his C's would be sharp 
N:(there aren't any accidentals in his setting). On the other hand, my key 
N:signature is Dmix, which means that all the C's will be natural. The truth is 
N:probably somewhere in between. Unfortunately this is the only setting of 
N:this tune that I can find, so I don't have anything to compare it to.

